1111	//  The persistent megakernel: ONE launch runs the SG2 optimizer step for
1112	//  ALL parameter tensors. gridDim.x = #SMs, 256 thr/CTA. Each CTA pulls
1113	//  WHOLE tensors from the task queue and runs sg2_meta_stages for each.
1114	//  ONE grid barrier at the end (so a composing model stage can reset the
1115	//  queue). The weight bundle is staged into smem ONCE per CTA up front.
1116	// =====================================================================
1117	// SG_TUNED_MEGA_BLOCK — unified with the fused megakernel's block-thread dim
1118	// (csrc/fused/sm_90/fused_megakernel.cuh). Default 256 (byte-identical untuned
1119	// build). NEEDS-PARITY before shipping a non-default winner (per-head PEER
1120	// routing + scan tiling assume the 256-thread shape).
